OL,3,GNEWSAShetland MSP defends hiring artist
OL,4,Awith public money
OL,5,
OL,6,FShetland MSP Hannah Mary Goodlad has
OL,7,Fdefended her decision to hire an
OL,8,F"artist in residence" for her
OL,9,Fconstituency, at a cost of #11,000 of
OL,10,Fpublic money.
OL,12,FThe SNP public finance minister is
OL,13,Frecruiting a Shetland-based creative,
OL,14,Fof any discipline, to engage with the
OL,15,Fcommunity and deliver projects
OL,16,Freflecting policy priorities.
OL,18,FThe 35 hour-a-week job - a
OL,19,Ffour-month-long contract paid from
OL,20,FGoodlad's parliamentary staff budget,
OL,21,Fhas been criticised by Reform MSP Max
OL,22,FBannerman as "state-funded propaganda."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
