OL,3,GNEWSAShetland MSP defends hiring artist
OL,4,Awith public money
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoodlad is also hiring a communications
OL,7,Fassistant to translate content into the
OL,8,FShetland language. She said the roles
OL,9,Fare essential to make politics "feel
OL,10,Fmore accessible" across the islands.
